entries[407669] = { ["name"] = "Avenger's Shield", ["text"] = "26% of base mana 30 yd range\nInstant 15 sec cooldown\nHurls a holy shield at the enemy, dealing [366 * (9.046514 + 0.676562 * 60 + 0.019349 * 60 * 60) / 100 + 0.091 * Spell Power + 0.091 * Attack Power] to [448 * (9.046514 + 0.676562 * 60 + 0.019349 * 60 * 60) / 100 + 0.091 * Spell Power + 0.091 * Attack Power] Holy damage, Dazing them and then jumping to additional nearby enemies. Affects 3 total targets. Lasts 5 sec." }
